# USER's MessageBox against real 3.11: COMMDLG's invalid file name box (string 393 with the name,
# caption 385, MB_OK | MB_ICONEXCLAMATION; two short lines) as Notepad's File > Save As shows it for
# "a,b" (arch311-ref/scn/cdlg-save.scn, first box); Enter answers OK.
# regress: sh tools/run-app-test.sh apps/build/mbox "$TEST" "$OUT" 0x30 COMMDLG.DLL:385 COMMDLG.DLL:393 a,b
